  "description": "Number 6 Aubreyville is a bright and well-appointed 2 bedroom ground floor apartment extending to approximately 65 sq m, ideally situated in the heart of Shankill village.\nThe property forms part of a small and exclusive development of just 9 apartments, set within attractive landscaped communal gardens and benefiting from secure gated access.\nThe accommodation comprises a welcoming living area, kitchen, two bedrooms, main bedroom with en-suite bathroom and fitted wardrobes, together with a separate laundry/utility room and storage room.\n\nProperty Features:\n\n•\t2 bedroom ground floor apartment\n•\tApproximately 65 sq m\n•\tMain bedroom with en-suite\n•\tFitted wardrobes\n•\tLaundry/utility room\n•\tSecure gated development\n•\tLandscaped communal gardens\n•\tSmall development of only 9 apartments\n•\tExcellent location in Shankill\n\nThis property would make an excellent home for first-time buyers, downsizers or investors, offering well-proportioned accommodation in a peaceful and well-maintained development.\n\nSize: Approx. 65 square meters\nService charge: €2750 p/a\nHeating: Electric central heating\nParking: Access to parking space\n\nDisclaimer: The above particulars are issued by Herbert & Lansdowne Estate Agents on the understanding that all negotiations are conducted through them. Please note that we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate and photographs provided for guidance only.",
